IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg4-s204-ratification`
IMPORT `dg4-s205-validity`

-- Tests of dg4-s205-validity.l4. Expected values are written by hand from the text of s 205
-- (de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, lines 733-763), beside each assertion, never copied from the module's own output.

§ `Tests of s 205`

§§ `(a): who may apply`

GIVEN corporation IS A BOOLEAN
      successor IS A BOOLEAN
      director IS A BOOLEAN
      holder IS A BOOLEAN
      holderThen IS A BOOLEAN
      affected IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 205(a) Applicant`
`t205 applicant` corporation successor director holder holderThen affected MEANS
    `s 205(a) Applicant` WITH
        `the corporation` IS corporation
        `a successor entity to the corporation` IS successor
        `a member of the board of directors` IS director
        `a record or beneficial holder of valid stock or putative stock` IS holder
        `a record or beneficial holder of valid or putative stock as of the time of a defective corporate act ratified under s 204` IS holderThen
        `a person claiming to be substantially and adversely affected by a ratification under s 204` IS affected

-- src:734: the corporation, a successor entity, a director, a holder of valid or putative stock, a holder as of the time of the act, any other person substantially and adversely affected
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- someone who is none of them (a stranger to the corporation) is not among those who may apply
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the person is among those who may apply to the Court of Chancery` (`t205 applicant` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))

§§ `(a)(1) to (5): what the Court may determine`

-- arguments: matter, an eligible person has applied, a ratification was made, it was effective
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of a defective corporate act ratified pursuant to s 204` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of a defective corporate act ratified pursuant to s 204` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of the ratification of a defective corporate act pursuant to s 204` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of the ratification of a defective corporate act pursuant to s 204` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- (3): an act not ratified, or not ratified effectively
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of a defective corporate act not ratified or not ratified effectively pursuant to s 204` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of a defective corporate act not ratified or not ratified effectively pursuant to s 204` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity and effectiveness of a defective corporate act not ratified or not ratified effectively pursuant to s 204` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- (4) and (5) need no ratification
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `the validity of any corporate act or transaction and any stock, rights or options to acquire stock` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `whether to modify or waive any of the procedures in s 204 to ratify a defective corporate act` TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- nothing may be determined unless an eligible person has applied
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the Court of Chancery may determine the matter on the application` `whether to modify or waive any of the procedures in s 204 to ratify a defective corporate act` FALSE FALSE FALSE)

§§ `(b): the orders`

#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `a declaration that a ratification in accordance with s 204 is not effective or is effective only at a time or on conditions established by the Court` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `validation and a declaration of effect of a defective corporate act or putative stock, with conditions imposed by the Court` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `a requirement of measures to remedy or avoid harm to a person substantially and adversely affected by a ratification or by an order of the Court` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `an order to the Secretary of State to accept an instrument for filing with an effective time specified by the Court` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `approval of a stock ledger for the corporation that includes stock ratified or validated` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `a declaration that shares of putative stock are shares of valid stock, or a requirement that the corporation issue and deliver shares of valid stock in their place` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `an order that a meeting of holders of valid stock or putative stock be held, with the Court's powers under s 227` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `a declaration that a defective corporate act validated by the Court is effective as of the time of the act or at another time the Court determines` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `a declaration that putative stock validated by the Court is deemed an identical share or fraction of a share of valid stock as of the time originally issued or at another time the Court determines` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `such other orders regarding these matters as the Court deems proper under the circumstances` TRUE
-- "in connection with an action under this section": with no such action, none
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(b) the Court of Chancery may make the order in connection with the action` `such other orders regarding these matters as the Court deems proper under the circumstances` FALSE)
-- (b)(3): harm that would have resulted had the act been valid is excluded
#ASSERT `s 205(b)(3) the harm is harm the Court may require measures to remedy or avoid` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(b)(3) the harm is harm the Court may require measures to remedy or avoid` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(b)(3) the harm is harm the Court may require measures to remedy or avoid` FALSE FALSE)
-- (b)(4): the filing date is the one s 103(c)(3) determines
#ASSERT `s 205(b)(4) the filing date of the instrument the Court orders accepted for filing` (YearMonthDay 2026 5 5) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 5 5

§§ `(c): service, joinder, notice`

#ASSERT `s 205(c) the corporation is deemed to have been served with the application` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(c) the corporation is deemed to have been served with the application` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(c) another party must be joined for the Court of Chancery to adjudicate the matter` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 205(c) the Court may require notice of the action to other persons and permit them to intervene` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the sentence speaks of an action filed by the corporation: for another plaintiff the text is silent
#ASSERT `s 205(c) the Court may require notice of the action to other persons and permit them to intervene` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(d): factors`

#ASSERT `s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `whether the defective corporate act was originally approved or effectuated with the belief that it complied with this title, the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `whether the corporation and its board of directors have treated the defective corporate act as valid, and whether any person has acted in reliance on the public record that it was valid` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `whether any person will be or was harmed by the ratification or validation of the defective corporate act` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `whether any person will be harmed by the failure to ratify or validate the defective corporate act` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `any other factor the Court deems just and equitable` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(d) the Court of Chancery may consider the factor` `any other factor the Court deems just and equitable` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 205(d)(3) the harm is to be considered` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(d)(3) the harm is to be considered` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(d)(3) the harm is to be considered` FALSE FALSE)

§§ `(e): exclusive jurisdiction`

#ASSERT `s 205(e) the court has jurisdiction to hear and determine the action brought under this section` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(e) the court has jurisdiction to hear and determine the action brought under this section` FALSE)

§§ `(f): the 120-day limit`

-- validation effective time 1 March 2026; notice under s 204(g) not required: last day 29 June 2026 (1 March + 120 days)
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the last day to bring an action of the kinds the subsection limits` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)
-- notice required and given 20 March (later than the validation effective time): 120 days from 20 March is 18 July 2026
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the last day to bring an action of the kinds the subsection limits` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 20)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 7 18)
-- notice given before the validation effective time: the later is the validation effective time
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the last day to bring an action of the kinds the subsection limits` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 20) TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 7 18)
-- notice required and not yet given: the period has not begun
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the last day to bring an action of the kinds the subsection limits` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- the day itself, and the day after: 29 June is the last day; 30 June is too late
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that a defective corporate act or putative stock ratified under s 204 is void or voidable due to a failure of authorization identified in the resolution adopted under s 204(b)` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29))
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that a defective corporate act or putative stock ratified under s 204 is void or voidable due to a failure of authorization identified in the resolution adopted under s 204(b)` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT `s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that the Court should declare in its discretion that a ratification under s 204 not be effective or be effective only on certain conditions` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that the Court should declare in its discretion that a ratification under s 204 not be effective or be effective only on certain conditions` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1))
-- an action that a ratification was not accomplished in accordance with s 204 is outside the limit
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that a ratification was not accomplished in accordance with s 204` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2027 1 1))
-- so is a person who was required to be given notice and was not
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that a defective corporate act or putative stock ratified under s 204 is void or voidable due to a failure of authorization identified in the resolution adopted under s 204(b)` TRUE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2027 1 1))
-- no last day yet: not barred
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim that a defective corporate act or putative stock ratified under s 204 is void or voidable due to a failure of authorization identified in the resolution adopted under s 204(b)` FALSE NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2027 1 1))
-- a claim of another kind is not one the subsection limits
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(f) the action is barred by this subsection` `a claim of any other kind` FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 6 29)) (YearMonthDay 2027 1 1))

§§ `(a) and (f) together`

#ASSERT `s 205(a) the person may bring the action` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the person may bring the action` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 205(a) the person may bring the action` FALSE FALSE)
